## Retired columns

Declared in `retired_columns:`. These columns keep their data and stay
declared, sealed and deployer-managed - so the `_UserAddedColumns.pq` drift
audit stays clean - but they are hidden from the New form, dropped from every
declared view and from any form body section, and their display title carries
a `(retired)` suffix. **Never delete them from the DBML:** deleting the
declaration does not delete anything on the site, it leaves a live, visible,
deletable column the schema no longer declares.

